sively matched copied repositories under `tmp/`:\n     - Produced many missing `node-pty` / missing workspace package errors.\n     - Fixed by using exact absolute test paths.\n\n   - Node DaemonClient tests on Windows:\n     ```text\n     listen EACCES ...\\Temp\\host-daemon-client-....sock\n     ```\n     - Windows cannot listen on the Unix-style filesystem socket used by that test harness.\n     - The strip-types module-load failure is fixed; the remaining EACCES is pre-existing/environmental.\n\n   - `DaemonSupervisor.test.ts`:\n     - two pre-existing Windows path expectation failures because tests assert Unix `.sock` while implementation returns `\\\\.\\pipe\\...`\n     - targeted new migration tests pass.\n\n   - Host-service typecheck:\n     ```text\n     src/terminal/terminal.ts(...): error TS2554: Expected 1 arguments, but got 2.\n     ```\n     - accepted pre-existing debt; line shifts with edits.\n     - no new companion/acknowledgment diagnostics.\n\n   - PTY daemon typecheck:\n     - existing `@lydell/node-pty` declaration debt:\n       - declaration is not a module\n       - implicit-any callback fields\n     - not caused by this work.\n\n   - Local `bun install`:\n     - native rebuild failed non-fatally due path with spaces and absent Visual Studio.\n     - postinstall continued.\n\n   - Local feature marker script:\n     - falsely reports all 147 markers missing on this Windows environment.\n     - direct `git grep` proves `(ANSWER-GUARDLESS)` and symbols exist.\n     - GitHub/Linux marker gate remains authoritative.\n\n   - GitHub workflow dispatch initially returned:\n     ```text\n     HTTP 404: workflow build-arm64.yml not found on the default branch\n     ```\n     - `gh` inferred upstream `superset-sh/superset`.\n     - Fixed by supplying:\n       ```text\n       --repo khairm/superset-windows-arm64\n       ```\n\n   - Attempts to stop already-completed reviewer agents returned “not running/no task”:\n     - no code impact.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n\n   Completed and shipped to GitHub:\n\n   - Removed all production answer guards.\n   - Made question detail/discovery independent of capability/session negotiation.\n   - Let pending questions pierce sidebar curation.\n   - Added daemon-level acknowledged PTY input.\n   - Added durable confirmed-outcome readback.\n   - Contained audit failures.\n   - Fixed transient transcript unreadability.\n   - Fixed ambiguous first-write duplicate risk.\n   - Added headless detached-session adoption.\n   - Added v2 ordinary-terminal compatibility and v3 acknowledgments.\n   - Added complete-sequence v2 fallback with durable unconfirmed fencing.\n   - Fixed transcript settlement race.\n   - Fixed heartbeat/tree parity.\n   - Bumped PTY daemon version.\n   - Fixed Node strip-types compatibility.\n   - Ran extensive Fable and Sol reviews until no BLOCKER/MAJOR/MINOR findings remained.\n\n   Commit and push:\n\n   - Commit:\n     ```text\n     ec83cf8e4 fix(host-service): make companion answers guardless and durable\n     ```\n   - 35 files changed:\n     ```text\n     1629 insertions, 604 deletions\n     ```\n   - Pushed:\n     ```text\n     origin/main -> ec83cf8e4\n     ```\n   - `/code-review low ec83cf8e4` completed with no findings.\n\n   Validation before that commit:\n\n   - Companion suite:\n     ```text\n     266 pass\n     0 fail\n     653 expect() calls\n     ```\n   - Guardless + fault probes:\n     ```text\n     18 pass\n     0 fail\n     ```\n     across tracked guardless tests plus scratch probe at that stage.\n   - PTY protocol/handler tests:\n     ```text\n     18 pass\n     0 fail\n     56 expect() calls\n     ```\n   - Targeted v2 migration:\n     ```text\n     1 pass\n     0 fail\n     ```\n   - PTY daemon bundle build:\n     - passed\n   - Scoped Biome:\n     - clean\n   - REFERR-GATE:\n     ```text\n     clean\n     ```\n   - Dependency overrides:\n     ```text\n     override-consistency OK\n     ```\n   - Unified versions:\n     ```text\n     version