{"parentUuid":"528cb1c0-cf5f-464f-b667-dbda0e43fcd0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"resp_0df8ae7c9942ba3a016a7a685183208191bbe8ce5a795e370b","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"codex-gpt-5-6-sol","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":843,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":202240,"output_tokens":620,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_4gHDR3Nah0t35lni9yKLek5X","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"C:\\Users\\khair\\.claude\\projects\\C--Users-khair-Code-Projects-fork-superset-windows-arm64\\memory\\project_companion_guard5_answer_path_fix.md","old_string":"Related: [[superset-companion-planning]], [[companion-durability-moved-to-hostdb]], [[companion-verification-recipes-and-traps]].","new_string":"**2026-08-10/11 ANSWER-GUARDLESS FINAL SHIP:** user locked the whole-UX contract: any captured pending Claude question with a real terminal target must remain discoverable and answerable from phone/watch regardless of transcript readability/state, live screen/render state, renderer availability, Windows display/lock/login state, mutable agent binding, permission axis, AskUser marker, read-side liveness, or negotiated answer capability/session state. Security/API boundaries retained: pairing/authenticated device, Cloudflare Access, sealed AES-GCM transport, nonce replay protection, schemas/semantic shape validation, exact current question+fingerprint at the last synchronous pre-write point, answer-wide lease, terminal lock, durable request claim/fence, actual PTY failures, and protocol-0 read-only. Commit `ec83cf8e4` removed every production answer guard, made pending questions pierce curation and capability hiding, added protocol-v3 correlated daemon-side `pty.write` acknowledgments, v2 whole-sequence legacy fallback with durable `unconfirmed` fencing, detached-session adoption before lease/lock, durable outcome write+readback, honest `not_written` vs `unknown`, audit-failure containment, and positive-only transcript settlement. Cleanup commit `7e0d25f3c` removed the retired ~4.6k-line guard/matcher/test stack while preserving `/v1/message` picker protections; Opus validation: REFERR clean, 200 companion tests + 11 fault probes passed, only accepted TS2554 debt; `/code-review low` found nothing. Both pushed to main. Full Windows ARM64 publish build `31443284669` succeeded on sha `7e0d25f3c0ecec91324b5302b265674269800cac`; prior build `31437447650` also succeeded on `ec83cf8e4`. Installer NOT installed yet—must wait for the user's explicit exact-time authorization because it closes Superset/session. Post-install verification still required: real phone/watch answer, renderer hidden/display off/Windows locked-login boundary, detached v2→v3 migration, acknowledgment+ledger logs, and no `guard_failed` answer outcome. Never log free-text bodies, keys, tokens, or transcript content.\n\nRelated: [[superset-companion-planning]], [[companion-durability-moved-to-hostdb]], [[companion-verification-recipes-and-traps]]."}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"b6576a4d-f5cd-4ee5-9598-9daacd19602d","timestamp":"2026-08-11T00:10:10.429Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.226","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
