epted + question pending; hook before/after ack race => confirmed only after both; wrong-PTY input-ok/no hook => accepted forever + discoverable; unreadable transcript unchanged; matching tool_result upgrades; mismatched terminal/toolUse cannot settle; restart preserves accepted; duplicate new request fenced; protocol-v2 unconfirmed; audit failures non-vetoing; E2E requires actual AskUser tool completion, never ledger alone; locked/renderer-off flow uses hook/tool-result and no screen reads.\n</agent-message>"}
