e fence","description":"Added real SQLite fence coverage and fixed issues it exposed: nullable questionId narrowing and claimed-status mapping. Tests prove confirmed/in-flight/unconfirmed fence across DB/ledger recreation, same request ID is excluded, and failed does not fence. 3/3 pass; scoped Biome clean.","activeForm":"Validating real SQLite fence","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]}],"itemCount":9},"type":"attachment","uuid":"134766dd-b79a-47b9-a010-e9d6f094c406","timestamp":"2026-08-12T13:16:03.663Z","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.228","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
